Always use TypeScript.
Always use Tailwind CSS v4 (CSS-based @import, no tailwind.config.js).
Never install @tremor/react — incompatible with Tailwind v4, confirmed.
Never install Bootstrap, jQuery, or any vanilla-JS template (e.g. Gentelella).
shadcn/ui is allowed but must be scoped under a .theme-shadcn class wrapper — never write tokens to :root.
Charts: use recharts only, already installed. No new charting library.
Never fabricate data. No hardcoded fallback numbers on API error — use 0 or explicit error states.
Read ANTIGRAVITY_BRIEFING.md in full before proposing any change.
